<item>
  <title>Scarborough FPU</title>
  <link>https://www.dodsalgroup.com/projects/scarborough-fpu</link>
  <description>&lt;span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.dodsalgroup.com/projects/scarborough-fpu" hreflang="en"&gt;Scarborough FPU&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;/span&gt;

      &lt;div class="field field--name-field-project-metrics field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden field__items"&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;  &lt;div class="paragraph paragraph--type--metrics paragraph--view-mode--default"&gt;
          
            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-metric-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;32,000 MT&lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-metric-description field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;&lt;p&gt;topside structure&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
      
      &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;  &lt;div class="paragraph paragraph--type--metrics paragraph--view-mode--default"&gt;
          
            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-metric-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;2,000 employees&lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-metric-description field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;&lt;p&gt;approximately working on site&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
      
      &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;
  


  &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-highlights field--type-text-long field--label-above"&gt;
    &lt;div class="field__label"&gt;Highlights&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li dir="ltr"&gt;In the top five of largest semi-submersible floating facilities ever built in the world&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li dir="ltr"&gt;When complete, the topside structure alone will weigh more than 32,000 MT, and when you add the hull, that weight more than doubles&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li dir="ltr"&gt;In designing the FPU, Dodsal Group has reduced the annual operational emissions of the facility by approximately 15% through the use of a hybrid gas-turbine and battery energy storage power system, combined with the use of waste heat recovery units&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;

            &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-project-description field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;&lt;p&gt;The project's extensive scope includes the full suite of engineering, procurement, construction, installation, and commissioning (EPCIC) services, as well as the design, fabrication, integration, transportation, and installation of the FPU's hull and topsides.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-solutions-category field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;FPU &amp;amp; FPSO&lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-spotlight-image field--type-image field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;  &lt;img loading="eager" src="https://www.dodsalgroup.com/sites/default/files/styles/webp/public/2024-10/Scarborough.png.webp?itok=O7Vrg-rE" width="864" height="576" alt="Scarborough Project" class="image-style-webp"&gt;


&lt;/div&gt;
      
  &lt;div class="field field--name-field-location field--type-string field--label-above"&gt;
    &lt;div class="field__label"&gt;Location&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;Australia&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;div class="field field--name-field-scope field--type-string field--label-above"&gt;
    &lt;div class="field__label"&gt;Scope&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;FEED &amp;amp; EPC&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;
</description>
